# Keep the build context small and keep evidence out of images.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/dist
**/build
**/.cache

# Never copied into an image: a container image is software, not a case file.
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/evidence_store
**/updates
**/staticfiles
**/.env

# Keys. The evidence key decrypts every sealed exhibit and the signing key makes
# a case package look like it came from this installation. Both were copied into
# every image built from a working checkout, because only databases and the
# evidence store were excluded: `docker run --entrypoint ls IMAGE -la /app`
# showed /app/.evidence.key. An image is carried across air gaps and shared;
# a key must never ride along. A deployment supplies its own (RUN_OFFLINE.md).
**/.evidence.key
**/.signing.key
**/*.key
**/*.pem
backend/reference_captures

.git
graphify-out
research
docs
*.md
